            <property name="text">
             <string>About the activity variables</string>
            </property>
           </widget>
          </item>
          <item>
           <widget class="QLabel" name="about_activity_label">
            <property name="text">
             <string>&lt;b&gt;Power per frequency band and sleep stage&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;• "Total" exports the average over the whole recording.&lt;br/&gt;• "Distribution per clock hour" exports the average for each real clock hour (hours 1 to 9 by default).&lt;br/&gt;• "Distribution per hour spent in each sleep stage" exports the average for each hour spent in each sleep stage, once the stage reaches an hour (hours 1 to 9 by default).&lt;br/&gt;• "Distribution per sleep cycle" exports the average for each sleep cycle (cycles 1 to 6 by default).&lt;br/&gt;• The maximum number of hours and sleep cycles, and the starting point (the first sleep stage or the sleep onset), are defined when you run "Analyze EEG Spectral Power".&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;Power per frequency band and annotation&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;• For a report of the analysis per annotation, the averages are given for each selected annotation.&lt;br/&gt;• "Distribution per hour spent in each sleep stage" is not available for these reports.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;Variable names&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;• The clean report has the same variable names as the input reports.&lt;br/&gt;• In the transposed report, the channel label and the frequency band are added to the variable name as a suffix, with abs for the absolute power or rel for the relative power.&lt;br/&gt;• For example, for the channel EEG F3-RC and the band 1 to 4 Hz, total_act becomes total_act_abs_EEG F3-RC_1_4 for the absolute power, and total_act_rel_EEG F3-RC_1_4 for the relative power.</string>
            </property>
            <property name="textFormat">
             <enum>Qt::TextFormat::RichText</enum>
            </property>
            <property name="wordWrap">
             <bool>true</bool>
            </property>
            <property name="variant" stdset="0">
             <string notr="true">help</string>
            </property>
